# Documentation Sync

After tasks that change behavior or structure, update docs **in the same PR/session**.

## Map

| Change | Update |
| --- | --- |
| New/removed route | `docs/README.md` routes table |
| Auth, roles, DB schema | `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §4, `docs/ACCOUNT_MODEL.md` |
| Env variable | `.env.example`, `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §8 |
| Product/SEO/taxonomy | `docs/PRODUCT.md` |
| PWA/SW/manifest | `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §6 checklist status |
| Architecture/stack | `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` |

## Do not

- Duplicate content across docs — cross-link instead
- Leave `TECH_SPEC.md` checklist stale (mark Planned → Done when implemented)

Use skill `.cursor/skills/trenio-docs-sync/` at end of feature work.
